WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.418
Don't you love your country?

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:03.962
You can't spell America without Erica.

00:00:11.015 --> 00:00:12.015
Mmm.

00:00:14.039 --> 00:00:15.432
Can I try the peppermint stick?

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.726
Haven't you already tried
the peppermint stick?

00:00:18.188 --> 00:00:20.687
Yes and I'd like to try it again.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:22.188
[Bell ringing]

00:00:22.977 --> 00:00:26.818
I'd like to try the peanut butter
chocolate swirl, please.

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:29.237
Ahoy! all hands on deck. Ahoy!

00:00:29.237 --> 00:00:31.197
[Bell ringing]

00:00:33.349 --> 00:00:34.349
Hmm.

00:00:35.679 --> 00:00:38.663
-Yeah, I don't know.
-You don't know if you can fit?

00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:41.458
Oh, I can fit.
I just don't know if I want to.

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:42.959
Are you claustrophobic

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:45.086
[snickers] I don't have phobias.

00:00:45.086 --> 00:00:48.089
-Okay, well what's the problem?
-The problem is,

00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:50.550
I still haven't heard what's in this

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.385
for Erica.

00:00:54.419 --> 00:00:55.889
[nautical tune playing]

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:01.394
More fudge please.

00:01:03.311 --> 00:01:04.064
Go on.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:07.776
Do this for America... Erica.

00:01:09.379 --> 00:01:10.153
Ooh!

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:11.988
I just got the chills.

00:01:11.988 --> 00:01:15.158
Oh, yeah, from this float,
not your speech.

00:01:17.071 --> 00:01:18.453
All right, nerds.

00:01:18.563 --> 00:01:19.563
I'm there.

00:01:19.981 --> 00:01:21.206
Do you-- Do you see anything?

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:23.333
-Booby traps?
-If I could see them,

00:01:23.421 --> 00:01:25.168
they'd be pretty shit traps,

00:01:25.256 --> 00:01:27.462
-wouldn't they?
-Thank you for that.

00:01:27.545 --> 00:01:28.588
[yells]

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:29.756
We're stuck in here.

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:30.756
Yeah.

00:01:30.932 --> 00:01:33.093
Just so you nerds are aware.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:36.221
I'm supposed to be
spending the night at Tina's

00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:38.473
and Tina always covers for me

00:01:38.473 --> 00:01:41.726
but if I'm not back for
Uncle Jack's party tomorrow

00:01:41.726 --> 00:01:44.771
and my mum finds out
you three are responsible.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.981
She's going to hunt
you down one by one and

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:53.154
Hey! Hey! Be careful, careful, careful!

00:01:53.154 --> 00:01:54.154
We don't even know what that is

00:01:54.154 --> 00:01:56.221
Exactly. It could be useful.

00:01:56.221 --> 00:01:57.742
Useful how?

00:01:57.742 --> 00:02:00.411
We could survive here a long time
without food,

00:02:00.411 --> 00:02:03.289
But if the human body doesn't
get water, It will die.

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:04.582
I hate to break it to you,

00:02:04.582 --> 00:02:07.502
But this is not water.

00:02:07.502 --> 00:02:08.962
No, but it's a liquid,

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:10.880
and if it comes down to
me drinking that shit

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:12.173
or dying of thirst

00:02:12.173 --> 00:02:13.424
I drink.

00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:16.719
You're all so nerdy it makes me physically ill.

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:19.681
Okay, it's official I'm never having kids.

00:02:19.681 --> 00:02:20.932
What are we doing here?

00:02:20.932 --> 00:02:23.101
We're laying low,
cooling off.

00:02:23.101 --> 00:02:24.101
like Oswald.

00:02:24.101 --> 00:02:26.271
Oswald was found in a
theatre and shot to death.

00:02:26.271 --> 00:02:26.938
Shh!

00:02:26.938 --> 00:02:28.565
-Shh!
-Shh!

00:02:29.526 --> 00:02:30.526
Erica?

00:02:31.532 --> 00:02:32.532
What the hell is that?

00:02:32.739 --> 00:02:35.238
A deadly weapon,
could be useful.

00:02:36.865 --> 00:02:37.615
For what?

00:02:37.615 --> 00:02:38.491
What do you think?

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:40.827
Taking down commie's,
saving your friends.

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:42.412
What? You're just
going to waltz in there

00:02:42.412 --> 00:02:44.205
like it's commie
Disneyland or something?

00:02:44.634 --> 00:02:45.634
I'm sorry who are you?

00:02:46.004 --> 00:02:47.083
Erica Sinclair.

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:47.834
Who are you?

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:50.378
Murray... Bauman.

00:02:50.378 --> 00:02:54.132
I'm sorry, why is this
four-year-old speaking to me?

00:02:54.132 --> 00:02:56.426
Uh, I'm ten you bald bastard!

00:02:56.648 --> 00:02:57.051
Erica!

